title: Revisionist leaders resign
new-page: true 
subtitle: Reformist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: reformist_dissent >= 60
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.reformist_strength < 10) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.burgher_marcher -= 2; 
    Q.guild_marcher -= 2; 
    Q.landed_marcher -= 2; 
    Q.banner_strength -= 200; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 25) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 5; 
    Q.burgher_marcher -= 3; 
    Q.guild_marcher -= 3; 
    Q.landed_marcher -= 3; 
    Q.banner_strength -= 250; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 40) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.burgher_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.guild_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.landed_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.banner_strength -= 300; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 60) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.burgher_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.guild_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.landed_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.banner_strength -= 350; 
} else {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 10; 
    Q.burgher_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.guild_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.landed_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.banner_strength -= 400; 
}

Q.reformist_strength *= 0.3; 

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors; 
if (Q.braun_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
if (Q.severing_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.braun_advisor = 0; 
Q.severing_advisor = 0; 
Q.reformists_resign = 1; 
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= Revisionist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the reformist faction. Many of our most experienced leaders have resigned. 
